# the Evil-warding Seal. Completed by a GM with the seal still held: Vunkerl Inlet [S], qm6: NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY
# (112 needs the accepted quest).
lists CrawlersNestS/Rodeupansat/onTrigger VunkerlInletS/qm6/onTrigger CrawlersNestS/onEventFinish/107
